Package: kavis-selftest
Architecture: any
Depends:
 ${shlibs:Depends},
 ${misc:Depends},
 xdotool,
 x11-utils,
Description: Kavis in-system automated UI test (madde 72)
 A test runner that generates mouse/keyboard events in the real session,
 logs every step and catches expectations and anomalies (coredump,
 process death, RAM jump, unknown window). Scenarios are a YAML subset
 under /usr/share/kavis/selftest; the report goes to
 ~/.local/share/kavis/selftest/<date-time>/.
